510:### 2.11 Release lifecycle\n537:### 2.12 CI workflows\n583:### 2.13 Go-vs-TS differential harness (temporary)\n658:### 2.14 M0 scaffold\n707:### 2.15 M6 cutover checklist\n773:### 2.16 Runtime startup (`src/cli.ts`)\n791:## 3. TypeScript module design\n868:## 4. Deliberate changes\n889:## 5. Test plan\n895:### 5.1 Bundle smoke tests (spawn `node dist/cli.js`)\n915:### 5.2 Assets and build info\n924:### 5.3 Third-party notices\n947:### 5.4 Package check\n977:### 5.5 Schema\n985:### 5.6 Differential harness\n990:## 6. Go baseline references\n1017:## 7. Resolved","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016WKFtQ842MJnofAjy5v3KG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
